  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\">&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a></p>\n<h1>動態光源光影</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>一款基礎的簡單光影，能讓手中持有的物品發光或產生光源。光源顏色會根據你手持的物品而改變（例如：火把、燈籠、螢石、紅石、靈魂類物品等）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fw4J9UkQ/images/33fcd3edfa2552311a2e52db0a133498050d28d2.gif\" alt=\"動態光源\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>你可以透過光影包設定&nbsp;<strong>關閉(0)/開啟(1)</strong>&nbsp;held_color_light 功能</p>\n<p>就這些了！歡迎參與貢獻 (<a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Dynamic-Light-Shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Hiba550/Dynamic-Light-Shader</a>)</p>",
